map.马步标准前脚承重 50%、身高系数 0.45、强度 0.85。\n重心偏移 co:
The horse stance has a standard front-foot load of 50%, a height coefficient of 0.45 and an intensity of 0.85.
Centre of gravity offset cogX = (50/100 − 0.5) × 80 = 0 cm (right at the midpoint of the step);
centre of gravity height = 170 × 0.45 − 30 = 46.5 cm (27.4% of height);
stability = 100 − |50 − 50| × 1.5 = 100;
endurance = 50 + min(40, 5 × 2) − min(1.5, 0.85 × 30/30) × (5 × 2) = 50 + 10 − 0.85 × 10 = 51.5 → 52 (pass).
If the front-foot load is changed to 65% (15 points away from the standard of 50%), stability falls to 100 − 15 × 1.5 = 77.5.
